# Dregscape Zombie's unearth {B} (CR 702.84a): discarded to Faithless Looting (paid with a Mox Ruby), it is unearthed from
# the graveyard, paid exactly with Mox Jet's {B}, and the pool ends empty. It has haste and attacks for 2, and is exiled at
# the beginning of the next end step. With Mox Emerald's {G} in place of the {B} (as much mana, one black fewer) it is not
# offered: the cost's colored pips are pinned, and none of it is generic.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Dregscape Zombie
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Dregscape Zombie; Island)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Graveyard.Dregscape Zombie.Activate(Ability: Unearth; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Dregscape Zombie.Activate(Ability: Unearth)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Attack(Dregscape Zombie > Bot2)
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Exile = Dregscape Zombie
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island
